# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile

### Get Agent Memory Status
GET https://{{apiHostname}}/api/v1/agentmemory/status
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload Single Document
POST https:///{{apiHostname}}/api/v1/agentmemory/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="test-document.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a test document content for agent memory.
It contains some sample text that can be indexed and searched.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="triggerIndexing"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### List Documents
GET https://{{apiHostname}}/api/v1/agentmemory/files?prefix={{prefix}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&continuationToken={{continuationToken}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rebuild Index
POST https:///{{apiHostname}}/api/v1/agentmemory/rebuildIndex
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
